* Behavioral CD4013B model for LTspice (FM decoder PLL dividers)
* Logic runs on VDD..VSS. SET and RESET assumed tied to VSS.
*
* One positive edge D flip flop (master slave, track and hold). Starts with Q low.
.subckt DFF D CLK Q QB VDD VSS
Bce ce VSS V=0.5+0.5*tanh(8*(V(CLK,VSS)/V(VDD,VSS)-0.5))
Bm VSS m I=u(time-1n)*1e-4*(V(D,VSS)/V(VDD,VSS)-V(m,VSS))*(1-(0.5+0.5*tanh(40*(V(ce,VSS)-0.4))))-u(1n-time)*1e-3*V(m,VSS)
Cm m VSS 1p
Rm m VSS 1e12
Bmq mq VSS V=0.5+0.5*tanh(20*(V(m,VSS)-0.5))
Bs VSS s I=u(time-1n)*1e-4*(V(mq,VSS)-V(s,VSS))*(0.5+0.5*tanh(40*(V(ce,VSS)-0.6)))-u(1n-time)*1e-3*V(s,VSS)
Cs s VSS 1p
Rs s VSS 1e12
Bq Q VSS V=V(VDD,VSS)*(0.5+0.5*tanh(20*(V(s,VSS)-0.5)))
Bqb QB VSS V=V(VDD,VSS)-V(Q,VSS)
.ends DFF
*
* CD4013B dual D flip flop (SET and RESET assumed tied to VSS)
.subckt CD4013 CLK1 D1 Q1 Q1B CLK2 D2 Q2 Q2B VDD VSS
X1 D1 CLK1 Q1 Q1B VDD VSS DFF
X2 D2 CLK2 Q2 Q2B VDD VSS DFF
.ends CD4013
